# Frontend environment template (Next.js)
#
# Copy to `.env.local` for local development. NEVER commit a real `.env` /
# `.env.local` (`.env*` with secrets is git-ignored).
#
# The app is provider-agnostic. With NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL UNSET it runs in
# demo mode (seeded offline data) and requires no backend. Set it to a
# deployed FastAPI URL to switch the live frontend to the real API.

# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://your-api-service.onrender.com
